Package: com.adarsh.chakra
Name: Chakra
Version: 1.0.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: A wheel of your apps on the edge of the screen. Tap the ball, or slide from it, to open apps, run system actions (Home, App Switcher, Last App, Lock, Screenshot, Torch, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and more) and your own links and Shortcuts. Glass background, double and triple tap actions, kept out of screenshots. Lives in SpringBoard: no helper app to keep running.
Maintainer: Adarsh
Author: Adarsh
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, preferenceloader, com.opa334.altlist
